				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7667303",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7667303,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [],
				"points": [
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							5461.151,
							198.892,
							9742.186
						],
						"pointId": 14953
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 766730101,
					"content": "#As the young {M#man}{F#woman} continued forth, {M#he}{F#she} noticed many exquisite statues dotting the mage's territory. \"What are these?\" {M#He}{F#She} asked, puzzled.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730102,
					"content": "\"These are all those who opposed me. They underestimated the power of a mage, and thus were turned to stone.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730103,
					"content": "Hmm, I quite like that. A spur-of-the-moment addition, but dare I say it was a good one. A mage ought to be a powerful and dangerous figure... Danger lends a certain mystique, and without mystique, the world would be a very dim place.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730104,
					"content": "(But turning people to stone at the drop of a hat... is that too over the top? And no one wants to be around someone that capricious... Okay, I think I'll dial it back and turn it into more of a vague warning.)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730105,
					"content": "Upon hearing this, the youngster broke into a cold sweat. But then, the mage's laughter broke the silence: \"Haha... Did you fall for it? I was merely joking. These statues are just my way of capturing a certain moment in time.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730106,
					"content": "\"Anyway, statues. That's what I need your help with. The mage's lodge is feeling a little empty, and I should like to fill the space with some more adorable companions.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7667302,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7667302
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7667302",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7667302,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [],
				"points": [
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							5482.98,
							194.651,
							9710.385
						],
						"pointId": 14939
					},
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							5480.907,
							194.819,
							9712.115
						],
						"pointId": 14940
					},
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							5481.945,
							194.575,
							9709.521
						],
						"pointId": 14942
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 766730201,
					"content": "#The young {M#man}{F#woman} was in awe of the mage's magnificence and beauty. After a lengthy silence, {M#he}{F#she} solemnly declared:",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730202,
					"content": "\"O great mage from afar, how beauteous and wise you are! The moment I beheld you, my heart began to flutter. All my heart desires now is to make your wishes mine.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730203,
					"content": "The subtlest of smiles appeared on the mage's face as she replied: \"Very well. Then I shall task you with performing certain deeds on my behalf, such as those that are within your ability. Your guide is here, and your reward awaits you in the days to come.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730204,
					"content": "Guide? ...Does that mean this glowing orb?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7667303,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7667303
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7667303",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7667303,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 766730301,
					"content": "\"Secret home...\" said the young wanderer, with a look of confusion on their face. \"Where is this 'secret home' of which you speak?\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730302,
					"content": "The mage's voice grew somewhat flustered upon hearing this question...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730303,
					"content": "(Wait, does it make sense for this to be a bashful character? ...Eh, never mind — I'll keep it in for now. Mr. Nine can always refine it later.)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730304,
					"content": "\"Ahem, it is rather rude to ask such questions of a mage, young one. The mage's lodge is under renovation. Very soon, you shall be stunned by its grandeur.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730305,
					"content": "\"This shall be your trial. Offer up your strength, and help this great mage to build her territory.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7667304,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7667303
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7667303",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7667303,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 766730401,
					"content": "\"Well then, young one. Now, you have learned of the troubles faced by this mage... Nicola Coco requires your aid to build her sacred territory.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730402,
					"content": "The mage poured a cup of tea for her visitor. \"What say you?\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730403,
						766730404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730403,
					"content": "It is my honor to serve!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730405
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766730405,
					"content": "Wait a minute! Shouldn't we think twice before going all in on this? We don't know anything about this person. And she seems a little weird...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730406,
					"content": "Huh... Although, having said that, this teacup looks kinda familiar...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730407,
						766730408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730407,
					"content": "Figured it out yet, Paimon?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730409
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766730409,
					"content": "Nicola Coco... Ah! Is it... Mage \"N\"? Nicole?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730410,
					"content": "Correct. What do you think of my story?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730411,
					"content": "Um... Hard to say. It's not finished yet, surely? What happens to the characters in the end?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730412,
					"content": "I haven't decided yet. I need to renovate my home first. Perhaps I'll have a burst of inspiration after that.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730413,
					"content": "Anyway, if you can hear my voice, I assume that means you're currently in Nod-Krai. In which case, could I trouble you to gather a few things for me?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730414,
						766730416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730414,
					"content": "What things, exactly?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730415
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766730415,
					"content": "Well, I'd like to build a few more statues to decorate my home, but I'm lacking inspiration at the moment. I was thinking you could take some photos to give me some ideas.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730418
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730418,
					"content": "Are you serious? ...Alright then. Leave it to us.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730419
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730419,
					"content": "Wait here — we'll head out and see what we can find. But remember to finish the story once the statues are done!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730416,
					"content": "Is it something to do with statues?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730417
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766730417,
					"content": "Exactly. I'm thinking of building a few more statues to decorate my home, but I'm lacking inspiration at the moment. So, I was thinking you could take some photos to give me some ideas.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730418
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730408,
					"content": "It's someone we know...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730409
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766730404,
					"content": "Great mage Nicola Coco, I will do as you command!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730405
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7667305,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7667313,
				7667315
