			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 766730601,
					"content": "Mm, the mage's story is starting to taking shape. I think I'll delegate this next section to Mr. Nine.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730602,
					"content": "A great mage is defined above all by her beauty and powerful presence. Perhaps an exaggerated laugh might help her stand out more.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730603,
					"content": "\"Ohohohoho! It looks like someone has been bewitched by the power of the Great Mage Everlasting!\" ...Is that laugh too annoying? No, it'll be fine — it's all in writing anyway. No one will hear it out loud.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730604,
					"content": "My renovation plan is complete... But where to start? Everyone knows you can't just conjure a house out of thin air. Hmm... Or could I?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730605,
					"content": "Alchemy could work. The only raw materials I need are bricks and wood... Yes, I'll go with that. Far easier than building everything by hand.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730606,
					"content": "A mage's home has to look very different from an ordinary house. I'm just not sure what that means in practice.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730607,
					"content": "One thing's for certain, though — it has to be an ancient, mysterious, and otherworldly place that will endure for hundreds, even thousands of years.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730608,
					"content": "Yes, that's good. Just what people would expect from a mage. Although in truth, it's not so much me capturing moments in time as moments in time that have captured me... hahaha.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730609,
					"content": "Well don't just stand there! Go, complete the task that the great mage has assigned!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730610,
					"content": "And remember, I don't want to see anything dull and dreary. I need photos that are bursting with life, so I can capture the soul and character of the subject.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730611,
					"content": "Don't be thinking that carving a statue is just about shapes and proportions. The most important thing is to capture the spirit of the subject in the moment the photograph is taken... Alright. Got all that?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730612,
					"content": "",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NONE",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730613
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766730613,
					"content": "\"Ohohohoho! It looks like someone has been bewitched by the power of the Great Mage Everlasting!\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730614,
					"content": "...Is that laugh too annoying?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730615,
					"content": "No, it'll be fine — it's all in writing anyway. No one will hear it out loud.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730616,
					"content": "Yes, that's good. Just what people would expect from a mage.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766730617
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				},
				{
					"id": 766730617,
					"content": "Although in truth, it's not so much me capturing moments in time as moments in time that have captured me... hahaha.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Observe"
				}
			]
		},
